    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### 2. Upload Your Dataset\n",
        "Upload the `subtitles_train.jsonl` file generated by your local `scripts/srt_to_jsonl.py` script.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
